I expect that only the Vorpal Blade does this. The Vorpal Blade comes
from *Lewis*Carroll*'s poem "Jabberwocky". The relevant verses:

    One, two! One, two! And through and through
       The vorpal blade went snicker-snack!
    He left it dead, and with its head
      He went gallumphing back.

Note that "vorpal blade" isn't capitalized. Properly, "vorpal" is an
adjective, so "vorpal blade" is just a blade that happens to be
vorpal. (In v. 3 of the poem, the same weapon is called a "vorpal
sword".) The Dev. Team took some liberties here...


To sum up: It's not a bug, it's YAFM.

